  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Klaz\u00fcmen</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A town in Lydia that, according to Pausanias, moved from an initial, mainland site thought by scholars to have been southwest of modern Urla Iskelesi to an island in the Bay of Smyrna (modern Klaz\u00fcmen). This place resource represents the later city; see also \"Klazomenai (earlier).\"",
